<title>SYRIA: Syria offers 4,000 tonnes of lentils for sale.</title>
<headline>Syria offers 4,000 tonnes of lentils for sale.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Establishment for Cereal Processing and Trade (GECPT) has offered 4,000 tonnes of lentils for export, an official spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He told Reuters August 18 was the final date for receiving bids. Confirmation would be made on August 19.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the lentils from the 1996 crop would be ready for shipment immediately and until September.</p>
</text>
